{
  "rc": {
    "_note": "5 小时窗口 · 21 迷你(2026-10-04):大字 = 这个窗口已用多少(按 API 标价,与 22 档同一个 winUsd);右 = 几点重置;底条 = 窗口时间走了多少(winPct,是时间进度不是额度 —— 官方剩余额度拿不到,同 22 档)。\n不在窗口里写一行「不在窗口中」;还没同步过 = 值位 --、条空着。",
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "title": "5 小时窗口",
        "resets": " 重置",
        "idle": "不在窗口中"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "title": "5-hour window",
        "resets": " reset",
        "idle": "No active window"
      }
    },
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FDFBFA\\,#FBF3F1)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#1A1A1C\\,#221E1F)@90",
        "_note": "5 小时窗口 · 21 迷你(2026-10-04):大字 = 这个窗口已用多少(按 API 标价,与 22 档同一个 winUsd);右 = 几点重置;底条 = 窗口时间走了多少(winPct,是时间进度不是额度 —— 官方剩余额度拿不到,同 22 档)。"
      },
      {
        "_note": "源色身份点:本包统一用 Claude 暖橙两档。",
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "10pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B"
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "19pt",
        "y": "9pt",
        "w": "90pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.title}",
        "fontSize": "11pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold"
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "113pt",
        "y": "10.5pt",
        "w": "35pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${at}",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentH": "2"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${winOn},1),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "big",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "10pt",
            "y": "27pt",
            "w": "78pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${winUsd},--)]",
            "fontSize": "16.5pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "lineBreak": "0"
          },
          {
            "id": "reset",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "90pt",
            "y": "32pt",
            "w": "58pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${winReset}${@i18n.resets}",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "alignmentH": "2"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(${winOn},1),0,1),1),if::(eq::(${live},1),1,0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "10pt",
            "y": "28pt",
            "w": "138pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.idle}",
            "fontSize": "13pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(${winOn},1),0,1),1),if::(eq::(${live},1),0,1),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "10pt",
            "y": "27pt+5.0pt",
            "w": "78pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "16.5pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "10pt",
        "y": "46pt",
        "w": "138pt",
        "h": "4pt",
        "bgColor": "#EEE4E0|#2A2522",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2pt",
          "leftB": "2pt",
          "rightT": "2pt",
          "rightB": "2pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(gt::(${winPct},0),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "10pt",
            "y": "46pt",
            "w": "138pt*${winPct}/100",
            "h": "4pt",
            "bgColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "2pt",
              "leftB": "2pt",
              "rightT": "2pt",
              "rightB": "2pt"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}